theme_override_fonts/font = ExtResource("1_eqlx6")
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 35
text = "\"Household Chores with Samuel is a 3D game designed to foster empathy and raise awareness about sensory differences and neurodiversity among neurotypical players. We recognize that every neurodivergent individual is unique. The main character, Samuel, represents a specific set of behaviors that may resonate with certain aspects of neurodivergent experiences, though each person’s experience is different.

The objective of this game is to complete household chores alongside Samuel, earning points for each task completed successfully. However, if tasks aren’t performed in a way that suits Samuel's needs, he may become upset, possibly even cry or run away, leading to a loss of points. Throughout the game, a coach character will guide you, offering advice on how to interact with and support Samuel as he navigates these activities.

There is a time limit to complete the game. Finishing before time runs out rewards bonus points, while taking longer results in a point deduction.

In essence, this game aims to simulate various communication methods and adaptations that might be beneficial for some neurodivergent individuals. Through Samuel’s experiences, neurotypical players can gain insight into sensory differences and the concept of neurodiversity.\""
autowrap_mode = 2

